+# Tool input validation
+
+| Field  | Value                |
+| ------ | -------------------- |
+| Issue  | re-cinq/HALEngine#37 |
+| Status | Draft                |
+
+Tool input is validated against the registered JSON Schema before an executor is called.
+
+## Contract
+
+1. Required properties, types and enums are enforced; a rejected call returns a result describing the property and constraint without its value, while valid input including extra properties reaches the executor unchanged. ([validated by: rejects invalid input and passes valid input unchanged](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L14))
+2. An invalid static schema fails at registration with the tool name. ([validated by: rejects an invalid static schema during registration with the tool name](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L36))
+3. A function-valued definition is validated against the schema resolved for each call. ([validated by: validates each call against the current dynamic schema](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts#L44))
diff --git a/src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts b/src/orchestration/tools/registry.acceptance.test.ts
